      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No 74 is a well-presented 1-Bedroom Ground Floor Apartment its own private entrance, offering added privacy and convenience. The property has been well maintained and improved over the years creating a fresh, contemporary living space ready for immediate occupation.\r\nLocation: Turvey Woods enjoys an excellent location within easy reach of Donabate Village, with its range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. Donabate Train Station is nearby, providing regular rail services to Dublin City Centre, making this an ideal home for commuters. The area also offers beautiful beaches, coastal walks, parks and a variety of recreational facilities.\r\nThis apartment would be ideal for a investor or a  or couple seeking a modern home in a convenient and well-connected location."
      },
